WEBVTT

00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:04.940
<i>Sora Tryon!</i>

00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:09.650
<i>Umi Tryon!</i>

00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:15.570
<i>Riku Tryon!</i>

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:19.490
Let's go!

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:20.200
Yeah!
Yeah!

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:25.790
Let's Try On!

00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:04.700
TRYON!

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:08.710
Saikyo Kido
TRYON

00:01:24.640 --> 00:01:27.680
M-Meijin. That's...

00:01:27.770 --> 00:01:30.810
D-Dare I say...

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:34.110
Gunpla...

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:39.070
...is freedom!

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:04.100
<i>Our wings couldn't wait for the wind, so we set out</i>

00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:09.600
<i>We were bathed in the light of the frozen sun</i>

00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:12.350
<i>Oh Oh Oh Oh Oh there are no limits</i>

00:02:12.350 --> 00:02:15.110
<i>Oh Oh Oh Oh Oh just let it go</i>

00:02:15.110 --> 00:02:20.650
<i>Oh Oh Oh Oh Oh loneliness won't break us</i>

00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:25.200
<i>At the end of the dream we'll never give up,</i>

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:27.830
<i>Will there be a future that can never end?</i>

00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:33.420
<i>Believe in what only you can do</i>

00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:36.130
<i>If I could seize one thing,</i>

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:38.840
<i>I'd choose it without hesitation</i>

00:02:38.840 --> 00:02:44.140
<i>Follow your instincts, just hold on to our bond</i>

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:50.680
<i>Up to the endless sky, now! Fly away</i>

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:12.040
<i>GUNDAM BUILD FIGHTERS TRY</i>

00:03:12.160 --> 00:03:16.000
Episode 16
Magnificent Shia

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:19.000
What is this Gunpla?

00:03:19.210 --> 00:03:21.840
Isn't it a super robot?

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:23.340
It's good.

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:26.800
Customizing it to your taste
is part of the fun of Gunpla.

00:03:27.300 --> 00:03:31.680
That's the essence of
Minato's Gunpla Shingyo School.

00:03:31.810 --> 00:03:34.100
S-So cool!

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:38.020
The three mecha combined
and became a mobile suit.

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:41.860
Yuu, is there any point
to them combining?

00:03:41.940 --> 00:03:43.030
None at all.

00:03:43.450 --> 00:03:45.820
If they got bigger when
they combined, maybe...

00:03:46.570 --> 00:03:48.580
Why the complex transformation?

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:51.540
It must be bad for
its structural strength.

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:53.250
There's no advantage.

00:03:53.790 --> 00:03:55.370
Shut your mouth, Yuuma!

00:03:55.370 --> 00:03:58.880
You don't understand originality. Go home!

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:01.500
Here they come.

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:04.800
It's just a paper tiger!

00:04:05.220 --> 00:04:06.680
Surround and destroy it!

00:04:14.850 --> 00:04:16.980
Don't underestimate the Tryon 3!

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:20.070
It deflected that attack...

00:04:21.480 --> 00:04:22.900
Our hearts reside...

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:24.990
...within this Gunpla!

00:04:25.860 --> 00:04:28.530
<i>Please, let me join your club!</i>

00:04:29.070 --> 00:04:31.490
<i>I know I'm asking for too much.</i>

00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:36.000
<i>But there's a guy
that I have to fight!</i>

00:04:36.660 --> 00:04:37.920
Please!

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:43.710
<i>Wait a minute, Sakai.</i>

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:45.590
<i>We're in the middle
of the qualifiers.</i>

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:48.640
<i>Asking us this all of a sudden...</i>

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:53.220
<i>You didn't join our Plamo Club,
though we invited you many times.</i>

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:54.470
<i>Why now?</i>

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:57.560
<i>I'm really sorry about that.</i>

00:04:57.690 --> 00:05:00.610
<i>But now I have a reason to fight!</i>

00:05:00.770 --> 00:05:02.770
<i>That's so selfish of you!</i>

00:05:03.230 --> 00:05:04.780
<i>Sakai.</i>

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:07.610
<i>We've already chosen
this year's team members.</i>

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:09.780
<i>Sorry, but...</i>

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:14.580
<i>If that's the case,
I can quit as a regular member.</i>

00:05:15.700 --> 00:05:17.460
<i>Kodera, what are you saying?!</i>

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:21.920
<i>Our semifinals opponent in the
the qualifiers is Kotei Academy.</i>

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:24.710
<i>There's no way we can win.</i>

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:28.340
<i>But if you join us...</i>

00:05:30.590 --> 00:05:31.970
<i>You're serious, Kodera?</i>

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:36.720
<i>We're third-year students,
headed for different high schools.</i>

00:05:36.810 --> 00:05:38.770
<i>This is our last tournament.</i>

00:05:38.850 --> 00:05:40.150
<i>Kodera.</i>

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:42.730
<i>I like this team.</i>

00:05:42.810 --> 00:05:47.610
<i>I want to play Gunpla Battle
with you all as long as possible.</i>

00:05:48.070 --> 00:05:49.530
<i>Sakai.</i>

00:05:49.530 --> 00:05:51.450
<i>You're the best of the
Gunpla Shingyo School...</i>

00:05:51.450 --> 00:05:55.830
<i>No, you're the best Gunpla builder
in all of Kansai. I'll leave it to you.</i>

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:01.460
<i>Take us to the National Tournament.</i>

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:06.840
<i>Kodera...</i>

00:06:07.670 --> 00:06:08.920
<i>I'm counting on you.</i>

00:06:10.220 --> 00:06:13.600
As its name suggests,
the Gunpla Shingyo School...

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:15.850
...is a school that
models one's heart.

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:18.180
Mr. Kodera's desire...

00:06:18.930 --> 00:06:22.480
Everyone's desire to
keep playing Gunpla Battle.

00:06:22.850 --> 00:06:25.650
Their hearts are modeled in...

00:06:25.650 --> 00:06:28.440
...the form of this Tryon 3!

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:32.570
Now let's go!

00:06:32.700 --> 00:06:35.070
Armed Booster!

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:38.910
An all-range attack?

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:40.500
Rocket punch?!

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:44.040
No way!

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:49.300
<i>Darn it! But his arms are...!</i>

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:55.970
You think you can stop
this Tryon 3 so easily?!

00:06:57.430 --> 00:07:00.640
<i>Liger Glare!!</i>

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:10.240
<i>Darn you.</i>

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:13.910
Let's end this.

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:16.570
<i>Heat Wing!</i>

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:24.330
Take this!

00:07:39.890 --> 00:07:41.140
<i>Battle ended.</i>

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:42.100
<i>The winner is Tendaiji Academy,
representing Osaka,</i>

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:44.140
<i>Tendaiji Academy</i>
<i>The winner is Tendaiji Academy,
representing Osaka,</i>

00:07:44.140 --> 00:07:44.770
<i>The winner is Tendaiji Academy,
representing Osaka,</i>

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:46.600
<i>team Build Busters!</i>

00:08:02.450 --> 00:08:04.960
You're strong, Tendaiji Academy!

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:06.870
Go for it!

00:08:14.920 --> 00:08:17.680
As I thought, he's really something!

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:19.470
Yeah, it's true.

00:08:20.350 --> 00:08:22.640
That's the Gunpla Shingyo School's...

00:08:22.850 --> 00:08:25.140
That's Minato Sakai's ability.

00:08:28.100 --> 00:08:29.860
A surprise dark horse, eh?

00:08:29.940 --> 00:08:31.480
Yes, Coach.

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:33.780
Minato.

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:36.780
<i>Run wild at the National Tournament.</i>

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:39.030
<i>I'm looking forward to it.</i>

00:08:41.240 --> 00:08:44.000
Hot-Blooded Gunpla Battle
Hot-Blooded Gunpla Battle!

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:47.670
<i>This was surely the
highlight of the first day.</i>

00:08:48.120 --> 00:08:53.630
<i>Yuuma Kousaka of team Try Fighters,
from West Tokyo's Seiho Academy.</i>

00:08:53.710 --> 00:08:54.050
Minato Sakai Yuuma Kousaka

00:08:54.050 --> 00:08:59.180
Minato Sakai Yuuma Kousaka
<i>Minato Sakai of team Build Busters,
from Osaka's Tendaiji Academy.</i>

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:02.510
<i>Minato</i> Sakai <i>Yuuma Kousaka
Two brilliant builders are
participating in the tournament.</i>

00:09:03.180 --> 00:09:06.060
<i>Having won many prizes
in model-building contests,</i>

00:09:06.060 --> 00:09:08.480
<i>Sakai is Kansai's top builder.</i>

00:09:08.560 --> 00:09:08.980
Minato Sakai Yuuma Kousaka

00:09:08.980 --> 00:09:10.560
Minato Sakai Yuuma Kousaka
Kousaka, on the other hand,

00:09:10.560 --> 00:09:14.280
<i>Minato</i> Sakai Yuuma <i>Kousaka
won the Grand Prix in this year's
Artistic Gunpla Contest.</i>

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:16.240
Minato Sakai Yuuma Kousaka

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:19.110
Minato Sakai Yuuma Kousaka
Please <i>watch</i> their interviews.

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:19.700
Mirai Kamiki

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:22.780
Mirai <i>Kamiki
This is Mirai Kamiki,
the tournament's image character.</i>

00:09:23.030 --> 00:09:24.540
Big sis is on TV?!

00:09:24.990 --> 00:09:28.540
<i>Kousaka, congratulations on
winning your first match.</i>

00:09:29.580 --> 00:09:30.880
<i>Th-Thank you.</i>

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:33.710
When were you interviewed, Yuu?

00:09:33.880 --> 00:09:35.630
It was right after the match.

00:09:35.840 --> 00:09:37.880
<i>Could you tell us your goal?</i>

00:09:37.880 --> 00:09:40.470
<i>Of course, we're aiming
to become champions.</i>

00:09:40.470 --> 00:09:43.100
<i>I've worked hard
to be able to say so.</i>

00:09:43.100 --> 00:09:44.720
<i>Thank you very much.</i>

00:09:45.930 --> 00:09:48.640
I'm sorry, I'll be back in a second.

00:09:48.730 --> 00:09:52.110
Hey, what? But you're on TV!

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:54.070
<i>Personally,</i>

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:57.820
<i>I'm eager to fight Mr. Yuuma
Kousaka, because he's my rival.</i>

00:09:58.240 --> 00:10:03.780
<i>But more than that, I want to play
Gunpla Battle with this team as long as possible.</i>

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:05.080
<i>So I'll try my best.</i>

00:10:05.700 --> 00:10:07.160
<i>Thank you very much.</i>

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:09.410
Those are my true feelings.

00:10:09.790 --> 00:10:11.500
I know that.

00:10:13.580 --> 00:10:15.460
What is it, Sis?

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:19.760
<i>Sei was streaming the
National Tournament online.</i>

00:10:19.760 --> 00:10:22.260
He told <i>me</i> you were on.

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:23.930
Mr. Sei did?

00:10:24.300 --> 00:10:27.770
<i>So, you've started
playing Gunpla Battle again.</i>

00:10:27.770 --> 00:10:28.850
Yes.

00:10:28.930 --> 00:10:33.150
<i>You made a promise to enter
the National Tournament with Fumi.</i>

00:10:33.150 --> 00:10:34.270
<i>And you fulfilled it.</i>

00:10:34.810 --> 00:10:35.900
Not yet.

00:10:36.440 --> 00:10:39.780
Our goal...
The goal of team Try Fighters...

00:10:39.780 --> 00:10:41.650
...is to be national champions.

00:10:41.780 --> 00:10:42.700
<i>Right.</i>

00:10:43.110 --> 00:10:46.580
<i>Even if it's from afar,
we're cheering you on.</i>

00:10:47.700 --> 00:10:49.450
Thanks, sis.

00:10:50.660 --> 00:10:53.790
First Day of the Tournament Competition Results
The first day's match results are as follows.

00:10:54.080 --> 00:10:56.710
A-As follows...

00:10:56.960 --> 00:11:00.170
I was only reported in text!

00:11:02.380 --> 00:11:04.430
Tournament Day 2

00:11:23.150 --> 00:11:26.570
<i>The winner is Eigakukan High School,
representing Shimane,</i>

00:11:26.570 --> 00:11:28.620
<i>team Shippujinrai.</i>

00:11:37.750 --> 00:11:39.380
Uzuki, find them!

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:40.420
Okay!

00:11:46.590 --> 00:11:47.220
A switch?!

00:11:47.470 --> 00:11:48.850
Don't let them fool you!

00:12:18.170 --> 00:12:19.670
<i>Battle ended.</i>

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:23.010
<i>The winner is Gabai Institute,
representing Kagoshima,</i>

00:12:23.010 --> 00:12:24.840
<i>team White Wolf.</i>

00:12:25.760 --> 00:12:27.590
Tournament Day 3

00:13:14.140 --> 00:13:15.560
<i>Battle ended.</i>

00:13:16.020 --> 00:13:18.980
<i>The winner is Toritsu Academy,
representing Niigata,</i>

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:20.810
<i>team SD-R.</i>

00:13:24.480 --> 00:13:26.150
Every team is so strong.

00:13:26.570 --> 00:13:27.740
Of course.

00:13:27.820 --> 00:13:30.410
They all made it through
the regional qualifiers.

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:33.450
The first round ends today.

00:13:33.450 --> 00:13:36.620
As of tomorrow's second round,
the seeded teams will be playing.

00:13:37.910 --> 00:13:39.500
The Gunpla Academy...

00:13:40.580 --> 00:13:42.290
Tenzan Academy from Miyagi.

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:45.760
They didn't let Junya lnose
play in the first round.

00:13:46.010 --> 00:13:48.170
They're saving him for later, eh?

00:13:48.470 --> 00:13:49.760
How pretentious.

00:13:50.510 --> 00:13:51.760
We don't care.

00:13:52.090 --> 00:13:54.680
We already know
Junya lnose's abilities.

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:56.350
More important is...

00:13:56.430 --> 00:13:58.930
The third-seeded Granada Academy.

00:13:59.020 --> 00:13:59.850
That's right.

00:14:00.440 --> 00:14:03.980
Lucas Nemesis, the European junior champ,

00:14:03.980 --> 00:14:06.320
came to study at the Granada Academy.

00:14:06.940 --> 00:14:10.860
It's not confirmed, but it's possible
he might play in the tournament.

00:14:11.030 --> 00:14:13.780
I'd like to fight
someone that strong.

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:16.830
Coach, what about Shia's Gunpla?

00:14:17.450 --> 00:14:18.870
It looks like it's finished.

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:23.210
The quality surpasses my own work.

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:29.260
It's pretty much perfect.

00:14:30.760 --> 00:14:33.050
Tournament Day 4

00:14:33.590 --> 00:14:36.060
The Gunpla Academy is up next.

00:14:36.560 --> 00:14:38.970
Last year's national champions, huh?

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:44.230
So, who's their third pilot?

00:14:44.810 --> 00:14:47.190
Whoever they send out,

00:14:47.400 --> 00:14:49.110
we'll measure their ability carefully.

00:14:49.440 --> 00:14:51.860
This match has really become
the center of attention.

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:53.070
Yeah.

00:14:53.410 --> 00:14:57.990
Everybody's talking about
that darned Gunpla Academy.

00:14:58.540 --> 00:15:02.040
I'll show them all. Me...

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:05.080
Kei Karima of Honmoku!

00:15:05.960 --> 00:15:06.290
<i>We now begin match one
of the second round.</i>

00:15:06.290 --> 00:15:08.420
<i>Gunpla</i> Academy <i>Honmoku Academy</i>
<i>We now begin match one
of the second round.</i>

00:15:08.420 --> 00:15:09.050
<i>We now begin match one
of the second round.</i>

00:15:09.420 --> 00:15:13.760
<i>Honmoku Academy, representing
Kanagawa, team Great K versus...</i>

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:18.350
<i>---Gunpla Academy, representing
Shizuoka, team Celestial Sphere.</i>

00:15:22.520 --> 00:15:23.560
That girl...

00:15:23.640 --> 00:15:25.100
She was the one at camp.

00:15:25.770 --> 00:15:27.610
So she was a fighter, after all.

00:15:28.070 --> 00:15:29.570
I can't believe it.

00:15:29.940 --> 00:15:32.450
Such a young girl?

00:15:32.900 --> 00:15:34.450
Wow, she's cute.

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:35.820
I'm about to fall in love.

00:15:36.820 --> 00:15:40.330
Your favorite has finally appeared, Lady.

00:15:41.200 --> 00:15:43.870
I wonder if she'll be my successor.

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:45.040
Or perhaps...

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:48.460
<i>Gunpla Battle, combat mode, startup.</i>

00:15:48.590 --> 00:15:51.130
<i>Model damage level, set to A.</i>

00:15:51.510 --> 00:15:53.470
Please set your GP Base.

00:15:54.130 --> 00:15:57.010
<i>Beginning Plavsky particle dispersal.</i>

00:15:58.680 --> 00:16:00.850
<i>Field 1, Space.</i>

00:16:01.390 --> 00:16:02.640
Please set your Gunpla.

00:16:03.100 --> 00:16:05.600
Shia, fight alone.

00:16:05.600 --> 00:16:07.860
Consider it a penalty for
completing your Gunpla so late.

00:16:08.150 --> 00:16:08.650
What?

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:10.570
What are you saying, Kijima?!

00:16:10.690 --> 00:16:13.860
Since we don't know the
performance of Shia's G-Portent,

00:16:13.860 --> 00:16:15.610
we can't plan any formations.

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:16.450
<i>But...!</i>

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:21.160
You're crazier than me.

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:22.790
Hey, Shia.

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:24.830
You've been chosen.

00:16:25.660 --> 00:16:27.500
As you wish.

00:16:36.010 --> 00:16:36.930
What?!

00:16:37.010 --> 00:16:38.550
Their systems aren't active?

00:16:38.970 --> 00:16:40.140
Having trouble?

00:16:40.760 --> 00:16:41.850
Impossible.

00:16:42.640 --> 00:16:44.730
You're saying they
did it on purpose?

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:48.520
Even for the Gunpla Academy,
that's pretty arrogant.

00:16:49.060 --> 00:16:50.480
<i>Battle start.</i>

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:56.280
Shia Kijima, G-Portent, here I go!

00:17:06.080 --> 00:17:07.830
That Gunpla is...

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:09.540
How beautiful.

00:17:09.960 --> 00:17:10.920
That's...!

00:17:17.680 --> 00:17:19.930
As I expected, a mobile armor.

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:29.100
Maybe it's a system error
or whatever, but...

00:17:29.350 --> 00:17:32.980
Taking on my Vagan Gear K
with one machine's a bad idea.

00:17:32.980 --> 00:17:36.190
The Gunpla Academy's legend ends here.

00:17:37.150 --> 00:17:38.490
Fool.

00:17:38.490 --> 00:17:40.570
You should say that after you win.

00:17:41.070 --> 00:17:42.780
I'll do that!

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:44.330
Support me, you two!

00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:45.040
Okay-
Okay-

00:17:45.120 --> 00:17:46.750
Go!

00:17:54.250 --> 00:17:55.960
There are so many!

00:17:56.050 --> 00:17:57.050
She can't dodge them!

00:18:03.140 --> 00:18:04.760
What movements...

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:08.600
Its touch is so delicate that
the missiles don't detonate.

00:18:08.680 --> 00:18:10.520
What makes it possible is...

00:18:10.850 --> 00:18:13.110
...the quality of that Gunpla!

00:18:16.860 --> 00:18:17.940
Magnificent.

00:18:19.110 --> 00:18:21.570
The girl's a prima after all.

00:18:24.620 --> 00:18:25.950
Then".

00:18:30.460 --> 00:18:31.750
Take this!

00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:43.470
A particle transformation field?!

00:18:47.140 --> 00:18:49.930
Hey, why don't you give up?

00:18:49.930 --> 00:18:52.020
I don't want to hurt your Gunpla.

00:18:52.100 --> 00:18:54.060
Definitely not!

00:19:01.240 --> 00:19:03.990
Take... this!

00:19:29.470 --> 00:19:32.390
Th-That's impossible.

00:19:44.450 --> 00:19:45.280
Sorry.

00:19:59.670 --> 00:20:00.840
No way...

00:20:00.920 --> 00:20:06.180
My Vagan Gear K was built
to beat the Gunpla Academy.

00:20:18.110 --> 00:20:19.440
<i>Battle ended.</i>

00:20:26.450 --> 00:20:28.570
My Vagan Gear K...

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:31.870
Beaten by a single Gunpla...

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:35.910
This is the ability of
the Gunpla Academy.

00:20:38.540 --> 00:20:43.010
So she's an even better builder
than Yuuma and I?

00:20:43.090 --> 00:20:46.050
Shia. That's a good Gunpla.

00:20:46.130 --> 00:20:47.760
Fight me later, will ya?

00:20:47.840 --> 00:20:49.680
Whatever.

00:20:49.760 --> 00:20:51.640
After the tournament, okay?

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:53.220
So he says.

00:20:53.680 --> 00:20:55.640
A-Amazing!

00:20:55.730 --> 00:20:57.560
It's too overwhelming.

00:20:59.150 --> 00:21:00.900
Fumina Hoshino.

00:21:01.610 --> 00:21:04.610
I wonder, can you defeat that girl?

00:21:05.490 --> 00:21:06.740
Ms. Lady.

00:21:11.030 --> 00:21:12.450
I'll win.

00:21:12.530 --> 00:21:14.290
My Star Winning will...

00:21:15.910 --> 00:21:18.170
...create a path to victory!

00:21:30.840 --> 00:21:32.600
You're still practicing this late?

00:21:33.060 --> 00:21:35.930
Watching that battle
got me all excited!

00:21:43.070 --> 00:21:45.110
It's been a while, Sekai.

00:21:45.780 --> 00:21:46.610
You're...

00:21:47.110 --> 00:21:48.150
Kijima.

00:21:49.070 --> 00:21:50.320
Shia Kijima.

00:21:50.490 --> 00:21:51.370
Kijima?

00:21:51.620 --> 00:21:53.700
Then, you're Wilfrid Kijima's...

00:21:54.120 --> 00:21:54.910
Right.

00:21:56.080 --> 00:21:57.250
His sister.

00:22:09.010 --> 00:22:12.050
<i>There's a tomorrow I want to touch</i>

00:22:12.050 --> 00:22:15.430
<i>I want to prove it for myself</i>

00:22:15.430 --> 00:22:20.230
<i>Love, hate, which is it?</i>

00:22:21.020 --> 00:22:24.060
<i>Perhaps the challenge is in the journey</i>

00:22:24.060 --> 00:22:27.190
<i>Wandering the unknown path...</i>

00:22:27.190 --> 00:22:33.910
<i>...toward abundant happiness</i>

00:22:35.700 --> 00:22:38.660
<i>I was afraid to run</i>

00:22:38.660 --> 00:22:42.040
<i>But now that I've started, I can't stop</i>

00:22:42.040 --> 00:22:44.880
<i>I must've been waiting for the go sign</i>

00:22:44.880 --> 00:22:48.710
<i>With this passion in my impatient heart,</i>

00:22:48.710 --> 00:22:53.390
<i>I want to search for something</i>

00:22:53.390 --> 00:22:58.100
<i>Let's meet over and over again (with you)</i>

00:22:58.100 --> 00:23:00.390
<i>On this journey, can you show me...</i>

00:23:00.390 --> 00:23:05.440
...a <i>different truth (let me see)</i>

00:23:05.440 --> 00:23:12.400
<i>The power to find new things (with me)</i>

00:23:12.400 --> 00:23:15.950
<i>Never forget it</i>

00:23:15.950 --> 00:23:18.240
<i>Bring the real you to meet the real me</i>

00:23:18.240 --> 00:23:18.790
<i>(Today)
Bring the real you to meet the real me</i>

00:23:18.790 --> 00:23:20.410
<i>(Today)
As we travel, you smile at me</i>

00:23:20.410 --> 00:23:21.290
<i>(I'll be there...)
As we travel, you smile at me</i>

00:23:21.290 --> 00:23:24.290
<i>(I'll be there...)
I love it, I love it, this journey without a compass</i>

00:23:24.290 --> 00:23:26.670
<i>(Alive!)
I love it, I love it, this journey without a compass</i>

00:23:26.670 --> 00:23:27.630
<i>(Alive!)</i>

00:23:27.670 --> 00:23:33.590
Team Try Fighters!

00:23:39.100 --> 00:23:41.020
The Gunpla Academy, huh?

00:23:41.100 --> 00:23:44.100
Mr. Lucas, a package for you.

00:23:44.600 --> 00:23:46.690
What a pleasant miscalculation.

00:23:46.770 --> 00:23:47.810
What is?

00:23:48.820 --> 00:23:52.070
With that team, I can battle in earnest.

00:24:00.660 --> 00:24:03.710
In the second round, Toritsu Academy
comes with a calculated strategy,

00:24:03.710 --> 00:24:05.500
and we're separated from each other.

00:24:05.500 --> 00:24:06.420
Next episode, "Haunted Castle Trap".

00:24:06.420 --> 00:24:07.630
Haunted Castle Trap
Next episode, "Haunted Castle Trap".

00:24:07.630 --> 00:24:09.340
Haunted Castle Trap
I hate ghosts.

00:24:09.340 --> 00:24:09.960
Haunted Castle Trap
